<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English League Cup</p>
<p>second round, second leg matches on Wednesday (with aggregate</p>
<p>scores):</p>
<p> Chelsea		   1   Blackpool	   3 (agg: 5-4)</p>
<p> Derby		     2   Luton		 2 (agg: 2-3)</p>
<p> Leicester		 2   Scarborough	 1 (agg: 4-1)</p>
<p> Peterborough	    1   Southampton	 4 (agg: 1-6)</p>
<p> Portsmouth		1   Wimbledon	   1 (agg: 1-2)</p>
<p> Queens Park Rangers   1   Swindon	     3 (agg: 3-4)</p>
<p> Tottenham		 3   Preston	     0 (agg: 4-1)</p>
<p> West Ham		  1   Barnet		0 (agg: 2-1)</p>
</text>
